    world: 'Nineteen Eighty-Four is set in London, chief city of Airstrip One in the superstate Oceania, permanently at war with Eurasia or Eastasia. The Party, led by the never-seen Big Brother, watches everyone through telescreens, rewrites the past at the Ministry of Truth and shrinks the language so that dissent cannot be thought. Winston Smith, a clerk who falsifies records, begins a forbidden diary and love affair, and is broken in Room 101.',
